  "notes": [
    {
      "sentence": 1,
      "chunk": 1,
      "source_English": "Marcel Ravidat, 18,",
      "text": "（18：插入语，补充说明年龄）"
    },
    {
      "sentence": 1,
      "chunk": 2,
      "source_English": "was on a woodland stroll near Montignac with Robot, his canine companion,",
      "text": "（his canine companion：同位语，补充说明 Robot）"
    },
    {
      "sentence": 1,
      "chunk": 3,
      "source_English": "when it began sniffing at a hollow left by a toppled tree.",
      "text": "（it 指 Robot；\nleft by a toppled tree：过去分词短语作后置定语，修饰 hollow）"
    },
    {
      "sentence": 2,
      "chunk": 2,
      "source_English": "for an adventurous excursion,",
      "text": "（for：表示目的）"
    },
    {
      "sentence": 3,
      "chunk": 2,
      "source_English": "Ravidat embroidered his anecdote with a dramatic twist.",
      "text": "（embroider A with B：用 B 给 A 添油加醋）\n（anecdote：关于某人真事的、有趣的小故事\n（趣闻轶事））"
    },
    {
      "sentence": 4,
      "chunk": 1,
      "source_English": "Robot, he said, had fallen into the cave.",
      "text": "（he said：插入语；\nhad fallen：过去完成时，掉洞在讲述之前）"
    },
    {
      "sentence": 6,
      "chunk": 1,
      "source_English": "The animal only nosed about the hole,",
      "text": "（nose about：到处嗅）"
    },
    {
      "sentence": 6,
      "chunk": 2,
      "source_English": "and the pivotal initiative was the boys' own.",
      "text": "（the boys' own：男孩们自己的，own 后省略了 initiative）\n（那只狗只是在洞口随便闻了闻，并没有往里钻。\n真正决定往下爬去探险的，完全是那几个男孩自己的主意。）"
    },
    {
      "sentence": 7,
      "chunk": 1,
      "source_English": "Ironically, the invented fall made the dog the hero of the story.",
      "text": "（make A B：使 A 成为 B）"
    },
    {
      "sentence": 8,
      "chunk": 1,
      "source_English": "Some 680 painted figures and 1,500 engravings cover the rock.",
      "text": "（some：大约，用在数字前）\n（几个男孩爬进去一看，好家伙，\n整个岩壁上密密麻麻全都是画！\n大概有680个是用颜料彩绘上去的图案，\n还有1500个是用工具刻上去的图案。）"
    },
    {
      "sentence": 9,
      "chunk": 1,
      "source_English": "The artwork is usually dated to between 17,000 and 22,000 years ago;",
      "text": "（be dated to：年代被断定为）"
    },
    {
      "sentence": 9,
      "chunk": 2,
      "source_English": "its creators, our distant ancestors, lived in antiquity.",
      "text": "（our distant ancestors：同位语，补充说明 creators）\n（antiquity：古时代（特别指古埃及、古希腊、古罗马时期））"
    },
    {
      "sentence": 10,
      "chunk": 1,
      "source_English": "Horses, bulls, and stags are among the animals depicted in pigments on the murals.",
      "text": "（be among：是……之一；\ndepicted in pigments on the murals：\n过去分词短语作后置定语，修饰 animals）"
    },
    {
      "sentence": 12,
      "chunk": 2,
      "source_English": "and tourism brought an influx of about 1,200 visitors a day.",
      "text": "（an influx of A：A 的涌入）"
    },
    {
      "sentence": 14,
      "chunk": 2,
      "source_English": "followed by restoration and daily inspection.",
      "text": "（followed by…：过去分词短语，表示随后发生的事）"
    },
    {
      "sentence": 15,
      "chunk": 2,
      "source_English": "and Lascaux II, a meticulously made partial facsimile, opened in 1983.",
      "text": "（a meticulously made partial facsimile：同位语，\n补充说明 Lascaux II）\n（meticulously：极其仔细地、一丝不苟地（连一点细节都不放过））"
    },
    {
      "sentence": 16,
      "chunk": 1,
      "source_English": "A white fungus invaded the walls in a 2001 outbreak,",
      "text": "（in a 2001 outbreak：在2001年的一次爆发中）"
    },
    {
      "sentence": 18,
      "chunk": 1,
      "source_English": "Admirers now meet the bulls only in a recreation,",
      "text": "（only in…：只在……中）"
    },
    {
      "sentence": 18,
      "chunk": 2,
      "source_English": "the originals being inaccessible to them.",
      "text": "（the originals being…：独立主格，补充说明原因）"
    }
  ],
  "approved_summary": [
    [
      "发现",
      "1940年，狗在地洞旁嗅闻引起拉维达注意；他随后与另外三名少年下洞，发现拉斯科史前壁画。"
    ],
    [
      "澄清",
      "后来拉维达把故事说成狗掉进洞里；其实狗只在洞口嗅闻，下洞探险是少年们主动决定的。"
    ],
    [
      "瑰宝",
      "洞内约有680个彩绘形象和1500幅雕刻图案，常被断代为距今约1.7万至2.2万年，描绘马、牛、鹿等动物。"
    ],
    [
      "受损",
      "1948年开放后，游客带来二氧化碳、热量、湿气和污染，壁画退化，1963年闭洞。"
